Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:56.38,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}満たされないままだった
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:59.06,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}独りよがりの emotion
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:02.61,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}はぐらかすように bringin' on
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.61,0:07:03.99,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}風を切って
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:06.81,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}失うものなんてない
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:09.44,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}守るべきものもない
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:13.98,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}遠吠えはいつか青い空に fly away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.74,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}Just tell me everything
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:18.82,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}答えを探しながら
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:22.02,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}たとえ無謀だと言われても
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:23.89,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}構わない
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:26.53,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}今扉を開けるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.42,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}起死回生望んだ future
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:34.30,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}手を伸ばして手繰り寄せる
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.20,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}This is my revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:39.85,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}ただつき進んでくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:45.67,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}運命さえ片っ端から get out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:46.99,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}I gotta do it alright
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:48.28,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}根拠も何もない
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.91,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}行く手を阻む奴は皆 no more chance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.06,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}似ても似つかない
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:53.52,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}ヒーローに成り上がれ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:56.23,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}笑え 共に prove my soul yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:59.06,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}誰かを守る強さを
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:01.73,op jp,,0,0,0,,この心臓に宿して
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.81,0:08:06.83,op jp,,0,0,0,,綱渡りのように climb to the top
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:56.38,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}一直都沒有得到滿足
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:59.06,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}總是自以為是的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:02.61,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}一直躁動彷彿要破碎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.61,0:07:03.99,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}風馳電掣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:06.81,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}感覺已經沒有什麼可以失去的了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:09.44,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}也沒有什麼應該守護的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:13.98,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}吶喊總有一天要在這晴空之下 高飛遠方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.74,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}只告訴我你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:18.82,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}一起去尋找那個答案
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:22.02,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}即便被說成魯莽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:23.89,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:26.53,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}現在打開內心封鎖的門扉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.42,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}希望那消失的未來能夠重新明亮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:34.30,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}伸出手讓我們走在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.20,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}這就是我的革命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:39.85,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}只需要與我一起同行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:45.67,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}就算命運也要在這一端開始讓路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:46.99,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}我必須去做到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:48.28,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}沒有任何的依據
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.91,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}阻擋去路的人都不可能得逞到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.06,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}似乎但也不如
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:53.52,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}成為那個頂點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:56.23,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}共同歡笑 證明我的內心是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:59.06,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}想要守護某人的堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:01.73,op zh,,0,0,0,,就寄宿在這顆心臟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.81,0:08:06.83,op zh,,0,0,0,,就彷彿是在走鋼絲一般 達到那個山頂
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.16,0:20:28.37,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}good bye これまでの僕よ
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.25,0:20:32.83,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}少しは強くなれたかい
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.37,0:20:37.48,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}いつも始まりは信じることから
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.55,0:20:41.05,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}やるべきことは知ってる
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.85,0:20:52.94,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}good luck これからの僕よ
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.94,0:20:57.15,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}要らぬプライドは放して
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.01,0:21:01.88,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}無くせぬものを拳に込めたら
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.95,0:21:05.16,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}自分のことを知れる？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.98,0:21:13.77,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}oh oh oh 眠らない心
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.83,0:21:19.80,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}oh oh oh 時は満ちたぞ
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.54,0:21:22.32,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}I will rock me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.38,0:21:28.16,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}いつだって It’s myself 唱えてる
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.22,0:21:30.41,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}そんな僕もまた
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.47,0:21:34.20,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}迷いが増え 涙も枯れ
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.27,0:21:38.83,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}怖くても 震える掌を
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.90,0:21:42.88,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}強く握って ライオンになって
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.94,0:21:46.03,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}全てを守れるか
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:28.37,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}就此別過 從前的我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.25,0:20:32.83,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}是否已變得足夠堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:37.48,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}萬物始於堅信的初心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:41.05,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}心中早知道使命何方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:52.94,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}請多珍重 未來的我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:57.15,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}放下那不必要的驕傲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:21:01.88,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}將無法割捨之物緊握
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.95,0:21:05.16,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}能否看清楚自我模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.98,0:21:13.77,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}oh oh oh 永不沉睡的心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.83,0:21:19.80,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}oh oh oh 時機已然成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:22.32,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我將撼動自己
